y month  without eating and these are people  could be senior citizens it could be  women with children matter of fact most  of them are that  and these are people that once they get  done paying for their rent or their  daycare center or their utility bills  they run out of money two or three days  and they find themselves going to food  banks or soup kitchens 49 million we  haven't had those kind of numbers since  nineteen sixty what is what does God  have to say about this well as I read  the scriptures he has a lot to say about  it there's over 2500 verses in the Bible  to deal with this issue and you can't  pick up the Old Testament New Testament  without reading about it I mean miroslav  talked about Matthew 25 but there's  probably not a page and in the scripture  that you can't read about the orphans  and widows the alien women and children  the sick people with leprosy the hurting  the lonely God talks about them  extensively there are some great verses  and proverbs to my verses that I really  like in Proverbs one is in 14 another  one is in 19 it says that and I'm  paraphrasing houses those that that are  gracious to the poor honor God and  another one says those who are gracious  those who are good to the poor those who  work with the poor lend to God I find  that kind of amazing because God doesn't  say that many places that if you do this  if you work with the poor if you help  them you lend to me you honor me  I got involved in this issue it probably  started when I was in the Peace Corps I  was in the Peace Corps for two years and  back in the late 1960s 67 68 but I  really got involved in this issue of  hunger in 1984 when Ethiopia was having  this horrendous famine in in its country  and they had lost a million people  through hunger and what had happened in  Ethiopia is that they were they had  droughts the drought turn in the famine  civil war started the leader of the  country wouldn't let him bunny in the  years country especially humanitarian 